sources:
  - kind: other
    path: soc/qcom/msm8998/harness/patches
    derived:
      - 0101-clk-qcom-msm8998-stub-gcc.patch
    note: >-
      Original gki_world work for the MSM8998 dev second stage.  The SoC device
      trees themselves come from dts/upstream at the pinned U-Boot commit; this
      patch adds only the stub GCC binding needed by the harness.
  - kind: other
    url: https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/torvalds/linux.git
    tag: v6.18
    license: GPL-2.0-only
    derived:
      - 0102-phy-qcom-msm8998-qusb2.patch
    note: >-
      MSM8998 QUSB2 register layout, init table and PHY config are taken from
      drivers/phy/qualcomm/phy-qcom-qusb2.c.  The optional-reset and PLL
      override handling is adapted to U-Boot's smaller driver.
notes: >-
  The patches apply after the global gkiw patches to the pinned U-Boot commit
  in global/harness/2ndstage/uboot.conf.
